  "notes": "Thermal-runaway propagation experiments on multi-cell modules; measurements are MATLAB table objects (also given as txt): cell voltages, cell temperatures, venting temperatures and surface temperatures. The landing page (mediaTUM) is behind a bot check, so no description could be read. Both delivered electrode-system folders explicitly identify graphite (GraphiteLFP and GraphiteNMC-811). The two extracted entities are modules, not two individual cells; the author surface-temperature READMEs reference cells 1 through 5 within each module. Temperature includes cell, venting and module-surface channels; cached combined extrema do not isolate cell sensors."
